<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>伤寒相舌秘法 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E4%BC%A4%E5%AF%92%E7%9B%B8%E8%88%8C%E7%A7%98%E6%B3%95/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 12:20:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E4%BC%A4%E5%AF%92%E7%9B%B8%E8%88%8C%E7%A7%98%E6%B3%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>伤寒相舌秘法</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-13-shanghanxiangshemifa/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 12:18:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-13-shanghanxiangshemifa/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“伤寒相舌秘法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;通过观察舌苔颜色、形态来辨识伤寒病邪之深浅、脏腑之寒热虚实，并确立治法方药&lt;/strong&gt;。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;舌为心之苗，又为脾胃之外候，脏腑经络之变皆可现于舌。辨舌之苔色、润燥、星点、裂纹，即可知邪在何经、热在何脏，从而精准用药&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>